uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DEN_FaithwardenStaff+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DEN_FaithwardenStaff+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\"> Special </span></h3>\n<p><b>The holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faithwarden%27s_Vines\" title=\"Faithwarden's Vines\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Entangle_Icon.webp/40px-Entangle_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Entangle_Icon.webp/60px-Entangle_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Entangle_Icon.webp/80px-Entangle_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Faithwarden's Vines\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Entangle_Icon.webp/40px-Entangle_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Entangle_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Faithwarden%27s_Vines\" title=\"Faithwarden's Vines\">Faithwarden's Vines</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 1 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Faithwarden%27s_Stride\" title=\"Faithwarden's Stride\">Faithwarden's Stride</a></dt><dd>Druidic vines cannot <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entangled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\">Entangled</a> you and do not count as difficult terrain.</dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weapon_actions\"> Weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <i>If you have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>, equip in <strong>main hand</strong> to gain:</i>\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Topple\" title=\"Topple\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Topple_Icon.webp/40px-Topple_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Topple_Icon.webp/60px-Topple_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Topple_Icon.webp/80px-Topple_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Topple\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Topple_Icon.webp/40px-Topple_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Topple_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Topple\" title=\"Topple\">Topple</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Swipe at a creature to knock it <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Inner_Sanctum\" title=\"Inner Sanctum\">Inner Sanctum</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-461&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-22</span>: Obtained from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rath\" title=\"Rath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Rath.png/25px-Portrait_Rath.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Rath.png/38px-Portrait_Rath.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Rath.png/50px-Portrait_Rath.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Rath.png/25px-Portrait_Rath.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Portrait_Rath.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rath\" title=\"Rath\">Rath</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kagha\" title=\"Kagha\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/25px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/38px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/50px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kagha\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/25px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kagha\" title=\"Kagha\">Kagha</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This weapon can only be obtained by druid player characters. At the conclusion of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Investigate_Kagha\" title=\"Investigate Kagha\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Investigate Kagha\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Investigate_Kagha\" title=\"Investigate Kagha\">Investigate Kagha</a>, if <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kagha\" title=\"Kagha\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/25px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/38px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/50px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kagha\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png/25px-Portrait_Kagha.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Portrait_Kagha.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kagha\" title=\"Kagha\">Kagha</a> is swayed to the party's side, she gives the player character the staff. If she is killed, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rath\" title=\"Rath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Rath.png/25px-Portrait_Rath.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Rath.png/38px-Portrait_Rath.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Rath.png/50px-Portrait_Rath.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Portrait_Rath.png/25px-Portrait_Rath.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Portrait_Rath.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rath\" title=\"Rath\">Rath</a> gives the player character the staff instead. This must be done before completing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_Druid_Halsin\" title=\"Rescue the Druid Halsin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rescue the Druid Halsin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_Druid_Halsin\" title=\"Rescue the Druid Halsin\">Rescue the Druid Halsin</a>.</li>\n<li>Nothing (including having this item equipped) prevents <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/38px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/50px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jaheira's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png/25px-Portrait_Jaheira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Portrait_Jaheira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira's</a> vines from ensnaring the player character during a cutscene at the entrance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> However, having received the staff and been named Faithwarden does provide a unique dialogue option with her.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Faithwarden's Stride:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Faithwarden's Stride only blocks the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Vines_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Vines (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain: Vines\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Vines_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Vines (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain: Vines</a> condition instead of the usual <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain</a> condition.</li>\n<li>Faithwarden's Stride's in-game tooltip states vines cannot \"ensnare\" you, however it actually blocks <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entangled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entangled_(Condition)\" title=\"Entangled (Condition)\">Entangled</a> rather than <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnared\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Condition)\">Ensnared</a></li></ul>\n</div>     \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 302px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Pale_Oak_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Appearance in game\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Pale_Oak_ingame.png/450px-Pale_Oak_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Pale_Oak_ingame.png/675px-Pale_Oak_ingame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/6/61/Pale_Oak_ingame.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Appearance in game\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Pale_Oak_ingame.png/450px-Pale_Oak_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Pale_Oak_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Appearance in game</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_2\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> If the party speaks with Jaheira at the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a>, an introductory cut-scene takes place with her there, during which the lead player character is ensnared in her vines as she interrogates them. This entanglement is plot-coded and unavoidable, regardless of any spell used or item equipped – including this one. While the player character (and the entire party) may avoid the cut-scene by, for example, sneaking into the area, its occupants will become hostile if they are discovered and Jaheira was not spoken with first at the Inn's entrance. </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n</di